Subject: [PATCH] logging: pack peer state and block request diagnostics

Convert fifteen peer state, validation feedback, block/header request, disk failure, eviction protection and stall diagnostics. PeerId denotes actual NodeId, BlockHash the actual block/locator hash, and Reason the existing explanation. Remove caller-side hash ToString calls; preserve branches, levels, categories and exact wording, including an existing double space. Add no registry fields or relay behavior.

